            { "Assigned {0} References and {1} Point IDs. Existing values were preserved.", "已填写 {0} 个 Reference、{1} 个 Point Id。已有值保持不变。" },
            { "Fill an empty reference only when the component's own scene has exactly one GeoReference, including inactive References. Never choose across scenes or overwrite existing references.", "仅在对象所属场景恰好有一个 GeoReference 时填写空引用，包括未启用的 Reference；不会跨场景选择或覆盖已有引用。" },
            { "Empty Point IDs use object names. Multiple selections are handled individually; duplicate names must be made unique manually.", "空 Point Id 使用物体名；多选时逐个处理，重复名称需手动修改为唯一 Id。" },
            { "Auto-fill is available only in Edit mode. At runtime, use Configure or another configuration API.", "自动填写仅用于编辑模式，运行时请使用 Configure 等配置 API。" },
            { "Only components in loaded scenes are supported. Prefab assets cannot be bound automatically.", "仅支持已加载场景中的组件，不能自动绑定 Prefab 资产。" },
            { ": References are not assigned automatically in preview scenes or Prefab stages.", "：预览场景或 Prefab 编辑环境不自动选择 Reference。" },
            { ": the object's scene has ", "：所属场景中有 " },
            { " GeoReferences; select one manually.", " 个 GeoReference，请手动指定。" },
            { "The object name is empty. Name it before using its name as a Point ID.", "物体名称为空，无法用作 Point Id，请先命名。" },
            { "' duplicates another Marker. Assign a unique name manually.", "' 与其他 Marker 重复，请手动改为唯一名称。" },
            { "Open Calibration Workbench", "打开标定工作台" },
            { "A candidate report is not an applied result. See Active calibration report for the mapping in use. All errors are measured in real meters.", "候选报告不表示已应用；实际使用的结果见 Active calibration report。所有误差均按现实米计算。" },
            { "Solving or an enabled accuracy check failed. Do not use this result. Check configuration, enabled limits, and per-point residuals.", "本次求解或精度检查失败，不能使用本次结果。请检查配置、启用的精度阈值和逐点残差。" },
            { "\nOriginal message: ", "\n原始说明：" },
            { "Disabled fields do not affect the selected mode. SingleAnchor requires exactly 1 Fit, Upright at least 2, and Spatial at least 3 non-collinear Fit points. Keep independent Check points.", "灰色字段不参与当前模式。SingleAnchor 至少 1 个 Fit，Upright 至少 2 个，Spatial 至少 3 个非共线 Fit；建议保留独立 Check。" },
            { "Edit in Calibration Workbench", "在标定工作台中编辑" },
            { "Update / configure in workbench…", "在工作台中更新／配置…" },
            { "View in workbench", "在工作台中查看" },
            { "No height model is installed. Orthometric output will fail.", "未接入高程模型，Orthometric 输出会失败。" },
            { "Assign a Transform Target. The component will not fall back to Kind automatically.", "请指定 Transform Target；不会自动回退到 Kind。" },
            { "Assign a Reference and initialize calibration before applying or sampling.", "先指定 Reference 并初始化坐标系，再应用或采样。" },
            { "Whether a calculated, unapplied candidate exists. Yes does not mean it is used for conversion; Apply Candidate activates it.", "是否有已计算、尚未应用的候选结果。Yes 不表示它已经用于坐标转换；点击 Apply Candidate 才会生效。" },
            { "Whether an applied calibration exists. It may differ from an edited Profile, and does not guarantee that the current Root transform is valid.", "是否存在已应用的标定结果。它不一定对应后来修改的 Profile，也不代表当前 Root 变换合法。" },
            { "Active-state version. Increments after successful apply or Clear, not after candidate calculation; it is not an apply count.", "生效状态的版本号。成功应用或 Clear 时递增，计算候选不会递增；不是应用次数。" },
            { "Whether solving and enabled accuracy checks passed. Without configured limits, True only means mathematical success, not that application accuracy requirements were met.", "本次求解及已启用的精度检查是否通过。未配置精度阈值时，True 只表示数学求解成功，不代表达到业务精度要求。" },
            { "Fit points used for solving / Check points used only for independent validation. Check points do not affect the solution or automatic origin.", "参与拟合的 Fit 点数 / 仅用于独立检查的 Check 点数。Check 不影响标定结果或自动原点。" },
            { "Root-local units per real meter. For example, 0.05 means 20 real meters per local unit. Does not include Root's world scale.", "现实一米对应多少 Root 局部单位。例如 0.05 表示现实 20 米对应局部 1 单位；不包含 Root 世界缩放。" },
            { "Weighted RMS of Fit-point 3D errors in real meters. Describes overall fitting error, not the maximum or accuracy at other locations.", "Fit 点三维误差的加权均方根，单位现实米。它概括参与拟合点的整体误差，不是最大误差，也不代表其他位置同样准确。" },
            { "Largest Check-point 3D position error in real meters, not reduced by weight. Each error is sqrt(E²+N²+U²): measured model position minus predicted position. This is measured error, not the permitted limit.", "所有 Check 点中最大的三维位置误差，单位现实米，不按权重缩小。每点误差为 sqrt(E²+N²+U²)，即填写的模型位置与预测位置之差；这是测得的误差，不是允许的误差上限。" },
            { "Whether the last positioning operation was valid. False preserves the last position instead of resetting the object to zero.", "最近一次定位是否有效。无可用映射或定位失败时为 False，但物体保留最后位置，不会被归零。" },
            { "Whether the last coordinate sample was valid. When False, LastValue may still hold a historical value and must not be used as a current coordinate.", "最近一次坐标采样是否有效。False 时 LastValue 可能仍保留旧值，不能当作当前有效坐标使用。" },
            { "Last successful latitude, longitude, and height, in degrees, degrees, and meters. Reporter Output Type / Output Height determine the reference.", "最近成功采样的纬度、经度和高度，单位为度、度、米；参考类型由 Reporter 的 Output Type / Output Height 决定。" },
            { "Whether the last attitude sample succeeded. When false, LastValue is historical. Vertical attitudes retain a valid quaternion but do not have uniquely separable heading and roll.", "最近一次姿态采样是否成功；false 时 LastValue 为旧值。竖直姿态的四元数仍有效，但航向和侧倾不唯一。" },
            { "Heading clockwise from reference north toward east, in [0,360). Undefined for vertical forward directions; no artificial zero is returned.", "相对参考北向东顺时针的航向，范围 [0,360)。前向竖直时没有稳定定义，不返回伪造的零度。" },
            { "Forward elevation relative to the reference horizontal plane. Positive means pitch up; range [-90,90] degrees.", "前向相对参考水平面的仰角，抬头为正，范围 [-90,90] 度。" },
            { "Clockwise roll using the GeoRotationOffset convention, in [-180,180). Heading and roll cannot be separated uniquely at vertical attitudes.", "与 GeoRotationOffset 相同定义的顺时针侧倾，范围 [-180,180)。竖直姿态不能唯一分离航向与侧倾。" },
            { "Control-point residual: supplied model position minus the position predicted from geographic coordinates, converted to real meters. Signed E/N/U components point east/north/up; negative values point west/south/down. Fit participates in solving; Check only validates.", "该控制点的残差：填写的模型位置减去地理坐标预测位置，再换算为现实米。E 为向东、N 为向北、U 为向上的有符号分量；负值分别向西、南、下。Fit 参与求解，Check 仅独立检查。" },
            { "No accuracy limits are enabled. Errors are calculated and displayed, but application accuracy is not assessed. This does not mean an error exceeded a limit. Enable Fit / Check limits in Profile > Options.", "未启用任何精度验收限制。当前只计算并显示误差，不判断是否满足业务精度；这不表示误差已经超标。可在 Profile > Options 中启用 Fit / Check 误差限制。" },
            { "The height zero uses an assumed ellipsoid height. Control points and POIs must use consistent conventions; this assumption cannot guarantee absolute height accuracy.", "高度零点使用了假定的椭球高。控制点与 POI 应保持一致约定；该假设不能保证绝对高程精度。" },
            { "Fit points extend more than 5 km from the ENU origin. Check the origin, scene extent, and suitability of fixed geographic axes.", "Fit 点距离 ENU 原点超过 5 公里。请检查原点设置、场景范围以及固定地理方向是否满足需求。" },
            { "The known heading vector deviates more than 5° from the horizontal plane. Solving uses its projection onto the Up-horizontal plane. Check Local Up and Local Heading Direction.", "已知航向向量偏离水平面超过 5°，求解使用了它在 Up 水平面上的投影。请检查 Local Up 和 Local Heading Direction。" },
            { "The control baseline is short and direction is sensitive to measurement error. Use reliable corresponding points farther apart.", "控制点基线较短，方向容易受测量误差影响。建议使用分布更远、位置可靠的对应点。" },
            { "Spatial uses only the minimum three Fit points. This cannot independently validate registration quality or all reflection ambiguities. Add distributed Fit points and independent Check points.", "Spatial 仅使用最少的三个 Fit 点，不能独立验证配准质量或所有镜像问题。建议增加分散的 Fit，并保留独立 Check 点。" },
            { "No height model is installed. Orthometric conversion returns MissingHeightModel and must not be treated as ellipsoid height.", "当前未接入高程模型，Orthometric 转换会返回 MissingHeightModel；不能直接当作椭球高。" },
            { "Select the horizontal coordinate type and height reference explicitly. The system never guesses them.", "必须明确选择水平坐标类型和高度参考，系统不会自动猜测。" },
            { "Original geographic coordinate with explicit horizontal and height references. At runtime, update through SetPlacement.", "锚点原始经纬高；必须明确水平类型和高度参考。运行时使用 SetPlacement 更新。" },
            { "Eastward offset from the original coordinate in real meters. Negative means west; this is not world X.", "相对原始坐标向东的偏移，单位现实米；负值向西，不是世界 X 偏移。" },
            { "Northward offset from the original coordinate in real meters. Negative means south; this is not world Z.", "相对原始坐标向北的偏移，单位现实米；负值向南，不是世界 Z 偏移。" },
            { "Offset along reference geographic Up in real meters. Negative means down; does not modify the source height.", "沿参考地理 Up 的偏移，单位现实米；负值向下，不改变源坐标高度。" },
            { "OnChange positions only when inputs or mapping change. Continuous writes on each synchronization; do not combine with a player movement script.", "OnChange 仅在配置或映射变化时定位；Continuous 每次同步写入，勿与玩家移动脚本竞争。" },
            { "Start position following automatically. If disabled, one successful explicit TryApply starts it. Disable the component to stop automatic following.", "是否自动启动位置跟随；关闭时手动成功 TryApply 一次后启动。停止自动跟随请禁用组件。" },
            { "Bound geographic Reference; switch through Configure at runtime. Missing calibration or invalid Root preserves the last pose and reports an error.", "绑定的地理坐标系；运行时通过 Configure 切换。未初始化或 Root 无效时保留最后姿态并报告错误。" },
            { "Configuration schema version. Only version 1 is supported; do not edit manually.", "配置格式版本，当前仅支持 1，请勿手动更改。" },
            { "Model-local coordinate convention ID. Set it explicitly and match the Reference.", "模型局部坐标约定标识，建议必填且与 GeoReference 一致。" },
            { "SingleAnchor: known direction and fixed scale; Upright: known Up; Spatial: full 3D similarity transform.", "SingleAnchor：单点方向与固定比例；Upright：已知 Up；Spatial：完整三维相似变换。" },
            { "Corresponding Root-local model positions and geographic coordinates. IDs must be unique. Fit solves; Check independently validates.", "Root 局部位置与现实坐标的对应点。Id 唯一；Fit 求解，Check 独立验收。" },
            { "Real-world Up in Root-local space, usually (0,1,0). Used by SingleAnchor/Upright; ignored by Spatial.", "Root 局部空间中的现实 Up，通常为 (0,1,0)。SingleAnchor/Upright 使用，Spatial 忽略。" },
            { "Root-local direction with a known geographic heading in SingleAnchor mode. Projected onto the Up-horizontal plane; must not be parallel to Up.", "单点模式中已知地理航向的 Root 局部方向向量；先投影到 Up 水平面，不能与 Up 平行。" },
            { "Geographic heading for the SingleAnchor direction: north 0, east 90, south 180, west 270 degrees.", "单点方向向量对应的航向角，北 0、东 90、南 180、西 270 度。" },
            { "Estimate positive uniform scale in Upright/Spatial. SingleAnchor always uses fixed scale.", "Upright/Spatial 是否估算正统一比例；SingleAnchor 始终使用固定比例。" },
            { "Positive Root-local units per real meter. Used by SingleAnchor or when Estimate Scale is disabled.", "每现实米对应的 Root 局部单位数，必须正数；单点或关闭 Estimate Scale 时生效。" },
            { "Origin, degeneracy checks, scale bounds, and Fit/Check acceptance. Errors and distances use real meters.", "原点、退化判定、比例范围及 Fit/Check 误差验收；误差和距离单位均为现实米。" },
            { "Reference used for capture; world position is converted into its Root-local space.", "采集时使用的坐标系；世界位置会换算到它的 Root 局部空间。" },
            { "Unique, nonempty control-point ID used in residual reports.", "控制点唯一且非空的标识，用于残差报告。" },
            { "Fit participates in solving. Check independently validates without affecting the fit or automatic origin.", "Fit 参与标定；Check 仅独立验证，不影响拟合和自动原点。" },
            { "Positive relative weight. Maximum residual is not weighted. Usually leave at 1.", "大于零的相对权重；最大残差不加权，通常保持 1。" },
            { "Real-world coordinate corresponding to the Marker's current position, with explicit horizontal and height references.", "Marker 当前位置对应的现实经纬高，必须声明水平类型和高度参考。" },
            { "Input horizontal reference: WGS84, GCJ-02, or BD-09. An explicit selection is required.", "输入水平坐标参考：WGS84、GCJ-02 或 BD-09；必须明确选择。" },
            { "Input height reference. Do not mix ellipsoid and orthometric heights. Orthometric currently fails without a height model.", "输入高度参考；椭球高与海拔不能混用。当前 Orthometric 无高程模型，会明确失败。" },
            { "Latitude in degrees. North positive, south negative; range [-90,90].", "纬度，单位度；北正南负，范围 [-90,90]。" },
            { "Longitude in degrees. East positive, west negative; normalized to [-180,180).", "经度，单位度；东正西负，规范化到 [-180,180)。" },
            { "Height in real meters under the selected reference. Not Unity Y.", "所选高度参考下的高度，单位现实米；不是 Unity Y 坐标。" },
            { "Absolute ellipsoid height of the relative-height zero, in meters. Only used by RelativeToEllipsoidZero.", "相对高度零点对应的绝对椭球高，单位米，仅 RelativeToEllipsoidZero 生效。" },
            { "Whether the zero's ellipsoid height is assumed. Produces a warning, not improved height accuracy.", "零点椭球高是否为假定值；报告会警告，不提升高程精度。" },
            { "Height-model ID for Orthometric only. No model is currently installed.", "正高模型标识，仅 Orthometric 使用；当前没有可用模型。" },
            { "Vector X component. Control-point positions use Root-local units, not real-meter offsets.", "向量 X 分量。控制点位置为 Root 局部单位，不是现实米偏移。" },
            { "Vector Y component. Control-point positions use Root-local units.", "向量 Y 分量。控制点位置为 Root 局部单位。" },
            { "Vector Z component. Control-point positions use Root-local units.", "向量 Z 分量。控制点位置为 Root 局部单位。" },
            { "Unique, nonempty control-point ID. Must not be duplicated within one request.", "控制点唯一且非空的标识；同一请求内不能重复。" },
            { "Fit participates in solving. Check independently validates accuracy.", "Fit 参与拟合；Check 只做独立精度检查。" },
            { "Must be positive. Weights affect Fit solving and Check RMS; maximum error is unweighted.", "必须大于零。Fit 影响求解，Check 影响 RMS；最大误差不加权。" },
            { "Model Root-local coordinate, not necessarily the Marker's parent-local localPosition.", "模型 Root 局部坐标，不一定等于 Marker 直属父级的 localPosition。" },
            { "Geographic coordinate corresponding to this model-local position, with explicit horizontal and height references.", "该模型位置对应的现实经纬高，需明确水平和高度参考。" },
            { "Fixed ENU origin. When disabled, use the Fit points' ECEF weighted center; Check points do not contribute.", "固定 ENU 原点；关闭时使用 Fit 点的 ECEF 加权中心，Check 不参与。" },
            { "Explicit origin WGS84 latitude in degrees. Does not inherit a control point's GCJ/BD reference.", "显式原点的 WGS84 纬度，单位度，不继承控制点的 GCJ/BD 类型。" },
            { "Explicit origin WGS84 longitude in degrees.", "显式原点的 WGS84 经度，单位度。" },
            { "Explicit origin absolute ellipsoid height in meters. Not orthometric or relative height.", "显式原点的绝对椭球高，单位米，不是海拔或相对高度。" },
            { "Minimum geographic baseline in meters. Short baselines make direction unstable.", "最小地理基线判定阈值，单位现实米；短基线容易导致方向不稳定。" },
            { "Spatial near-collinearity distribution ratio. Larger values reject more configurations; default 0.0001.", "Spatial 近共线判定的分布比阈值，越大越严格；默认 0.0001。" },
            { "Minimum positive scale in Root-local units per real meter.", "允许的最小正比例，单位 Root 局部单位/现实米。" },
            { "Maximum positive scale in Root-local units per real meter.", "允许的最大比例，单位 Root 局部单位/现实米。" },
            { "Reject calibration when weighted Fit 3D RMS exceeds its limit.", "是否拒绝 Fit 三维加权 RMS 超限的标定。" },
            { "Reject calibration when weighted Fit vertical RMS exceeds its limit.", "是否拒绝 Fit 竖直加权 RMS 超限的标定。" },
            { "Check weighted Check-point 3D RMS. Requires independent Check points when enabled.", "是否检查 Check 三维加权 RMS；启用后必须有独立 Check 点。" },
            { "Check maximum Check-point 3D error. Requires independent Check points when enabled.", "是否检查 Check 最大三维误差；启用后必须有独立 Check 点。" },
            { "Limit 3D distance from the ENU origin, including height and final placement offsets.", "是否限制到 ENU 原点的三维距离；包含高度和最终放置偏移。" },
            { "Weighted Fit 3D RMS limit in real meters; used only when the corresponding switch is enabled.", "Fit 三维加权 RMS 上限，单位现实米，仅对应开关启用时生效。" },
            { "Weighted Fit vertical RMS limit in real meters.", "Fit 竖直加权 RMS 上限，单位现实米。" },
            { "Weighted Check-point 3D RMS limit in real meters.", "Check 三维加权 RMS 上限，单位现实米。" },
            { "Maximum single Check-point 3D residual in real meters; unweighted.", "单个 Check 点的最大三维残差上限，单位现实米，不加权。" },
            { "Maximum ENU 3D radius in real meters, not just horizontal distance.", "允许的 ENU 三维半径上限，单位现实米，不只是水平距离。" },
            { "Orientation source. Use Transform Target overrides this when enabled.", "朝向来源。勾选 Use Transform Target 时由 Transform 目标覆盖。" },
            { "Heading in degrees: north 0, east 90, south 180, west 270. Used only in Heading mode.", "航向角：北 0、东 90、南 180、西 270 度，仅 Heading 模式使用。" },
            { "Target geographic coordinate for GeoTarget mode, with an explicit reference.", "GeoTarget 模式的目标经纬高；必须明确参考系。" },
            { "Fixed world target position for WorldTarget mode, in Unity world units.", "WorldTarget 模式的固定世界目标位置，单位 Unity 世界单位。" },
            { "Continuously tracked scene target. Destruction preserves the last rotation and reports an error; no fallback target is selected.", "持续追踪的场景目标；销毁后保留最后旋转并报错，不回退为其他目标。" },
            { "Use Transform Target instead of Kind and other sources while enabled.", "启用时优先使用 Transform Target，Kind 和其他来源暂不生效。" },
            { "Horizontal projects onto the reference Up-horizontal plane. Full3D retains height differences. Not used for fixed heading.", "Horizontal 投影到参考 Up 的水平面；Full3D 保留高度差。固定航向模式不使用。" },
            { "Yaw offset from the base orientation in degrees. Positive turns right/clockwise.", "基础朝向上的偏航角，正值向右/顺时针，单位度。" },
            { "Pitch offset from the base orientation in degrees. Positive means pitch up.", "基础朝向上的俯仰偏角，正值抬头，单位度。" },
            { "Roll offset around the forward axis in degrees. Positive means clockwise.", "沿前向轴的侧倾偏角，正值顺时针，单位度。" },
            { "Model-local axis correction applied after geographic rotation. Must be a unit quaternion; default +Z forward, +Y up. Alternatively rotate the visual child.", "地理旋转之后应用的模型局部轴修正，必须是单位四元数；默认 +Z 前、+Y 上。也可旋转视觉子节点。" },
            { "Start orientation following automatically. If disabled, one successful explicit TryApply starts it. Disable the component to stop automatic following.", "是否自动启动朝向跟随；关闭时手动成功 TryApply 一次后启动。停止自动跟随请禁用组件。" },
            { "Initially empty reads self. A destroyed explicit target reports an error instead of falling back to self. Switch targets through Configure at runtime.", "初始为空时读取自身；显式目标销毁后报错，不回退为自身。运行时切换使用 Configure。" },
            { "Unit quaternion removed before measurement. Use the same Model Correction as GeoOrientation to report its logical attitude; identity measures the Transform's own axes.", "单位四元数。若目标由 GeoOrientation 控制，可填写相同 Model Correction，测量时先移除此修正；identity 直接测量物体自身轴。" },
            { "Automatic sampling interval in seconds. Zero samples on every Reference synchronization. TrySample samples immediately.", "自动采样间隔，单位秒；0 表示每次 Reference 同步均采样。TrySample 可立即采样。" },
            { "Transform to read; initially empty reads self. Destruction of an assigned target reports an error without fallback. Switch through Configure at runtime.", "读取的 Transform；未指定时读取自身。已指定目标销毁后报错，不自动回退。运行时切换用 Configure。" },
            { "Output horizontal coordinate type; explicit selection required. GCJ/BD conversion fails outside the supported region.", "输出水平坐标类型；必须明确选择。GCJ/BD 范围外转换失败。" },
            { "Output height reference. Orthometric currently fails because no height model is installed.", "输出高度参考；Orthometric 当前没有高程模型，转换会失败。" },
            { "Absolute ellipsoid height of the relative-height output zero, in meters. Only used by RelativeToEllipsoidZero.", "相对高度输出的零点绝对椭球高，单位米，仅 RelativeToEllipsoidZero 使用。" },
            { "Whether the relative-height zero is assumed. Does not improve actual height accuracy.", "相对高度零点是否为假定值；不增加实际高程精度。" },
            { "Orthometric height-model ID. No model is installed; entering a name alone does not enable conversion.", "Orthometric 高程模型标识；当前未安装模型，仅填写名称不能启用转换。" },
